---
title: "asking first"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: you ask
  s1: Claude picks a tool
  s2: the tool runs
  s3: waiting for your OK
  s4: stopped, nothing happened
  s5: you review the result
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you ask for something
  s1 --> s2: it runs at once [tool set to Always allow]
  s1 --> s3: it asks first [tool set to Needs approval]
  s1 --> s4: it stops [tool set to Blocked]
  s2 --> s5: it finishes
  s3 --> s4: you say no
  s3 --> s2: you click Allow
  s4 --> s0: you ask again
  s5 --> s0: you ask again
